  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/andreasgriffin/bitcoin-safe/tarball/2.3.0",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/andreasgriffin/bitcoin-safe/zipball/2.3.0",
  "body": "### \ud83d\udcc5 [Schedule plugin](https://bitcoin-safe.org/en/plugins/schedule/)\r\n**For businesses and organizations:** pay employees or manage any regular or future obligation with a fixed amount, in any currency.\r\n\r\n- \ud83d\udcca Keep track of future payouts\r\n- \u23f0 Get notified when a payment is overdue\r\n- \u26a1 Batch payouts with a single click\r\n- \ud83d\udcbe Save and manage recipient addresses (with optional PGP-signed messages)\r\n\r\n### \ud83d\udd14 [Notifications plugin](https://bitcoin-safe.org/en/plugins/notifications/)\r\nStay in the loop on wallet activity through the channels that work for you. Get alerts about wallet transactions, scheduled payments, and more via:\r\n\r\n- \ud83d\udd17 Webhook\r\n- \ud83d\udfe3 Nostr\r\n- \ud83d\udcac Telegram\r\n- \ud83d\udcc6 Calendars (CalDAV)\r\n- \u2709\ufe0f Email\r\n\r\n### \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f More Robust Transaction Broadcasting\r\nBroadcasting is now more resilient \u2014 if the first broadcast times out, your transaction is automatically relayed through other peers, so your payments get through."
